			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["74B8B99C87A3BABC"]
			description: ["Calcium-48 and an actinide target make atoms heavier than anything in nature. They live for seconds, so the chemistry is built around speed. The Superheavy Census closes the lane."]
